    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: Diagnostics only. Skip GPU compression and return every download as an
        uncompressed success (CompressionErrorCode = CompressionBypassed). Use on
        a device build to confirm that download and display work before debugging
        the encoder.
